"P2801130255" "Rescue Rikti negotiator quickly"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1254846727" "If those orders you found are half-way correct, then you need to get to that area on the double and keep them from killing this C'Kelkah."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
