// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Description :
"P1308416561" "Locate C'Kelkah"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2143724032" "You saved the Traditionalist Rikti negotiator C'Kelkah from assassination by the Malta Group. The peace talks should be able to continue."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3573139720" "You were unable to save the Traditionalist Rikti negotiator C'Kelkah from assassination by the Malta Group. You are uncertain if the peace talks will continue."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3007170412" "Now, I'm no telepath, and I am certainly no alien telepath, but from people I know who are privy to such information, there are a lot of Rikti buzzing about the save you pulled off there. This C'Kelkah lady seems to be very influential among the Traditionalist Rikti. So, the talks will continue, and who knows? Maybe something will come out of it. World could sure use a little more peace, at least in my opinion."
// RandomFameString :
"P1760359935" "Rikti attacks have decreased a lot lately. Do you know anything about that, {HeroName}?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnFailure 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2944196145" "Well, the good news is that negotiations between the peoples of Earth and the Traditionalist Rikti are still going to continue. The loss of C'Kelkah was a major blow, but the Rikti seem to be taking it well. As I understand it, they don't seem to blame the death on humanity in general, but they are questioning how they can be promised any kind of safety when some of our mightiest heroes, and they meant you, weren't able to protect a single negotiator. Or at least, that's the line they're taking right now. The talks will go on, and that's a good thing."
// RandomFameString :
"P2389117037" "I thought Rikti attacks were decreasing. Guess I was wrong, huh, {HeroName}?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Malta_Compound4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - SoulCrystal 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P4219969813" "An Oranbegan Soul Crystal"
// DetailString :
"P2594670879" "This perfectly geometric crystal is inscribed with magical runes and lines of power. Properly used, it could remove the soul from a victim and store it indefinitely. It is currently translucent and is not glowing, indicating that it is empty of souls."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - SorcererFled 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P650017150" "Dyaomesk has fled"
// DetailString :
"P3937370412" "The surviving Circle sorcerer you saved from the Malta Group attack in Oranbega told you: <br><br>'I am not the one called Dyaomesk, for he has fled this place in his foolish panic. He sought protection from these outsiders with other outsiders. This lack of faith in the power of the Circle betrays a traitorous cowardice, and in one we once trusted to work our will in the world above. We observe, we wait, and we shall not interfere. He is shunned by us, and forbidden this place until the world of mankind has perished. He has chosen his protectors, and shall profit of perish by that choice. <br><br>'You may go safely from our halls. I can see that you work with those Dyaomesk made his deals with, and we shall honor them.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - DyaoTalks 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P268733774" "Dyaomesk's story"
// DetailString :
"P3919467609" "After you rescued him from the Knives of Artemis and the Malta Group, the Circle of Thorns sorcerer Dyaomesk told you: <br><br>'This would likely have gone better had I stayed the course and hid in Oranbega. It was their fault that this all happened! I only did my job. I was ordered to observe the outside world, and stumbled onto your 'Cold War.' I met Roger Vrabel and learned of his Titan project, and though I thought of the plan myself, the Circle were the ones who gave me approval to carry it out. I took a body and offered my services to help him hunt down other mages for this group. I intended to provide him the average and funnel the best along to the Circle for our own use, all the while working to indoctrinate Vrabel into our service. Sadly, Vrabel could not be subverted, so I falsified my own death and returned to the safety of Oranbega. But now that the aliens have broken our wards, I knew it was only a matter of time before I was found. The Circle kept sending me out on missions! It was unfair! They must have known I would be found out. I knew that they would try to hunt me down. Your associates found me first and promised some measure of safety in exchange for information and further spy work. <br><br>'Now it seems that it's all been brought down upon me. I must remand myself to your custody and prepare myself for any indignity I must now suffer to save my existence. Oh, to have fallen to such a sorry state due to the incompetence of others! I must use your vulgar modern vernacular to properly compound insult upon indignity and state: This blows.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3962017769" "One of our informants needs help, {HeroName}. He's been discovered, and stands a good chance of being captured and killed by Malta Group agents. Normally you'd expect me to mention some crazy complication at this point, and you are correct in that assumption. You see, this particular informant is a member of the Circle of Thorns. Even so, he still needs protection from the Malta Group. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Can I count on you to extract him?</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P2201758314" "Extract the Circle of Thorns informant"
// SendOffString :
"P1516000853" "The informant's name is Dyaomesk, and he's been very helpful in keeping tabs on certain Malta Group operations. The back story on this one gets a little strange. Indigo will give you some of it, she's the one who located and recruited him in the first place. You're first step will be to meet with her in person so she can brief you properly."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Malta_Compound4_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P42127188" "You're first step will be to meet with Indigo in person so she can brief you properly about Dyaomesk and this situation."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P425704161" "I'm sure Crimson told you the bare basics and nothing more, {HeroName}, so I'll give you a bit more background. The informant is a member of the Circle of Thorns called Dyaomesk. He claims to be some kind of ancient sorcerer-ghost, but a lot of people claim to be a lot of things, and I've only ever seen him walking around in a body. Ghost or not, the danger he's in is real. After I discovered him, Dyaomesk and I worked out a little arrangement where he provides information to me, and in exchange I make sure that our mutual 'friends' never find him. Unfortunately, it looks like they were able to locate him despite my efforts. Operatives have infiltrated Oranbega, the Circle's underground city, and are trying to catch Dyaomesk. I need you to get him out of harm's way. <br><br>Dyaomesk's affiliation may be distasteful, but the information he's been able to provide for use against those 'friends' of ours has been extremely valuable, and he's saved a lot of lives by keeping tabs on what they're up to. Losing him would be a major blow to our efforts."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Malta_Compound4_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P152930843" "Protect Dyaomesk"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3988885615" "Indigo is right about Dyaomesk. He's not her sole source of information, but he can keep track of some pretty weird stuff. Protecting him from the Malta Group is a top priority."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1523211321" "The oppressive weight of the ancient ruins of Oranbega is somehow thrown off-balance by the harsh smell of cordite and C4."
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2626591562" "You know, I feel like I'm being watched down here."
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P3986129925" "This place is creepy enough without you saying that all the time."
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3412411441" "Great. I prefer a stand-up fight!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P2996046556" "Heretic Green Epsilon"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1202423608" "What do you mean we can't find him? Peel off the robes till we know we got him!"
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1429002211" "So, {HeroName}, are you ready to die?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Body 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2256854103" "This is the body of a Circle mystic. It's been perforated by high-powered bullets."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P652572338" "Circle mystic"
// Description :
"P624429639" "Find Dyaomesk"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P2300283371" "I am not the one you seek, but I will tell you of him."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P546333739" "You arrived in Oranbega only to find that Dyaomesk had already escaped the Malta Group's agents. "

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Malta_Compound4_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1402999678" "You better go and get debriefed by Indigo. She may have an idea of where to find Dyaomesk before the Malta Group can."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3671483449" "Dyaomesk will be in our custody soon enough, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3274437591" "It looks like Dyaomesk saw the attack coming and had already escaped before you even got there. Dyaomesk has always been kind of skittish, I suspect that he didn't quite trust you. Now, he has no choice. It seems that the Knives of Artemis were doing the clean-up work for our 'friends', and they've got him cornered in an old section of graveyard. This could be the last chance to get him out of danger. You've got to get to him before the Knives of Artemis can."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Malta_Compound4_Part4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1454428137" "Save Dyaomesk"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2540044772" "Whether he's called Dyaomesk or Diomeds, He's a useful resource that needs protection. We're counting on you, {HeroName}."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3411669683" "You're too late to save Dyaomesk, {HeroName}!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LocationName :
"P701169431" "Wakeman Graveyard"
// EntryString :
"P2384094555" "Somehow, you're not surprised to find out a fleeing Circle Sorcerer would seek safety in a graveyard."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// - ScriptDef - PlayTogetherMission 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P150412424" "Sister Circe"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P962864226" "Find the magus. This ends tonight."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2438971654" "This is our hunt, {HeroName}. The only place you have here is as additional prey."
// Script Variable MISSION_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4279832017" "You will fall to the blades of the Knives of Artemis!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Hostage 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P614729913" "Dyaomesk"
// InteractCompleteString :
"P3806984114" "I am Dyaomesk. I owe you my thanks, and more."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3871453806" "You rescued Dyaomesk from the Knives of Artemis and the Malta Group."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2420795971" "Dyaomesk can be difficult to work with, {HeroName}, but you came through like a star. Well done, very professional. Indigo is hard at work pulling the final strings right now, but we should be able to get Dyaomesk into a secure situation soon. I think MAGI wants to use him to cross-check the information they've gotten from another Circle traitor they've got under wraps. Fortunately, we have secure channels of our own in there, so we should still be able to get intel from him. All in all, a very satisfactory conclusion. <br><br>If you were paying attention, you'll understand why Malta wanted Dyaomesk so badly. He was there back in the days of Vrabel's old Project Titan, and he knows secrets he still hasn't told any of his employers. Just because he's some kind of ghost doesn't make him immune to their techniques. Malta's got some mages of their own, some of whom Dyaomesk probably taught back in the 60's. What concerns me is that the Circle was obviously trying to get their hooks into Vrabel back then, and while it didn't work against him, I have to wonder how many people they did get? The Circle likes taking over secret societies, and intelligence agencies worldwide are secret societies of a sort. Really, really powerful ones. Now that's a thought to help kick up your paranoia."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Malta_Compound5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - TomAble 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1764867123" "Tom Able's odd words"
// DetailString :
"P218686182" "After you rescued Tom Able from the Malta Group, he spoke to you with a broken expression and eyes filled with sorrow: <br><br>'They told me this would happen one day. They told us we couldn't run, and they proved it. They'd always come to check, every year. They would just tell us to accept it, or else they'd, they'd... <br><br>'I'm sorry, {HeroName}, but my wife and I, we're just normal people who've been powerless against these men for so many years. I can't tell you anything. I wish I could, but there's nothing I can do.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - FertilityRecords 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1706954165" "Robert Able's file"
// DetailString :
"P488909306" "You found this file in Falcone Pharmaceuticals, a front company for the Malta Group. The file is from the fertility clinic that Tom and Anita Able consulted, which helped produce their son, Robert. The file shows that the couple were unknowingly used in a biological experiment by a faction within the Malta Group. <br><br>According to the file, the Ables were chosen from among several couples for their close physical resemblance with a tissue donor the Malta Group wanted to make a genetic duplicate of. They produced a clone and implanted it into Anita Able instead of the child they'd hoped to conceive, all without the Ables' knowledge or consent. The man the Ables were used to clone was none other than Roger Vrabel, the original head of the Malta Group."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - TheOldGuard 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P2396027968" "The old guard"
// DetailString :
"P3633569838" "After his defeat, the Malta operative called Helix Black said the following to you: <br><br>'You're taking our future away from us. When the Cold War ended and the Berlin Wall fell, that's when it all went wrong. Younger agents asked what we were supposed to do now, and we didn't have an answer. So they made up a new one. There weren't any communists left to fight, so we'd help expand democracy and capitalism. Expand them by any means necessary. That was the new guard. That's when Malta started to change. <br><br>'Before, everything we did we did to protect the Western world. The new guard, they say they're doing that, but they also want wealth and power and even more control. If we could just have gotten Roger back. Re-made him in Robert. He'd run Malta for years. He'd get it on track. He would have changed everything! It all would have been right again!'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - VrabelEngram 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1226128204" "An old tape back-up"
// DetailString :
"P2986099864" "This large spool of magnetic tape weighs nearly 20 pounds. This kind of computer equipment hasn't been used in decades. It's labeled: <br>'Personality Recording <br>'Subject: Roger Vrabel <br>'Date: 1981.'"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P407287481" "A young fellow by the name of Robert Able has been targeted for capture by the Malta Group. I know that they've been watching this kid for about a decade, and if I'm right, then more than his life is in danger. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I think it would be safer if Robert was out from under their watchful eye and under our protection.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P3659351280" "Protect Robert Able from the Malta Group"
// SendOffString :
"P1845410436" "Robert's out on a little camping trip right now along with his folks. You'll need to rescue the whole family, or else Malta will use them as leverage. Once you've handled that situation, you'll need to meet with Indigo. She'll have more information for you at that time."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Malta_Compound5_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3485370981" "Save Able family"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P741428895" "The Able family's camping trip is about to be cut short. You need to rescue the whole family, or else Malta will use them as leverage."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// LocationName :
"P4119740909" "Black Owl Wildlife Preserve"
// EntryString :
"P2256118976" "Though this might be a pleasant place to experience the great outdoors, you know that agents of the Malta Group aren't out here to relax."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// - ScriptDef - PlayTogetherMission 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
