// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Malta_Compound5_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3469231160" "You need to meet with Indigo. She has more information for you about the Able family situation."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1349846082" "Tell us where you're hiding Robert Able!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2828107686" "The Able family's been under surveillance by our 'friends' for several years. They get visits from Malta operatives, usually twice a year, even though they've moved several times. Other than that, they're completely unremarkable. He's an mechanical engineer specializing in air conditioning systems, she's an administrative assistant with a degree in English, they tend to vote conservatively, and have excellent savings. They've never had marital counseling and neither of them have any criminal record. Robert is a good student who used to have a weight problem until he hit a growth spurt two years ago. He'll probably be joining the army to get enough money for school, unless he gets some student aid. Nice enough people, but not the sort of folks Malta would be interested in. <br><br>Except that Robert was conceived en vitro at a clinic called Genrove Fertility. Shortly afterward, agents of our 'friends' started visiting the Able family. I have the feeling these two events are related. The Genrove clinic itself was destroyed in the war, but their records are being kept by the company that owned them. That company is Falcone Pharmaceuticals, a front for our 'friends' from Malta. I'll give you the location, you'll need to find the file on what makes the Ables special. After you get them, take them to Crimson. If we're right, then he should have the next step ready for you."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Malta_Compound5_Part3 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1816363912" "Find the Ables' files"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2855903152" "You can thank Indigo for doing all the footwork on this one. You'll need to find the files on the Able family from their old fertility clinic."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P3667880534" "As you enter the offices of Falcone Pharmaceuticals, you notice a pronounced lack of office workers. Like Indigo said, this company appears to be a front for the Malta Group!"
// Script Variable ACTOR_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1162938051" "Keep ready. Briefing said that {HeroName} captured Robert Able."
// Script Variable ACTOR2_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2919261765" "Do you think {HeroName} could come here after us?"
// Script Variable ACTOR_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1485401236" "It's {HeroName}!"
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P3696154473" "Helix Black 08-08"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1192414414" "{HeroName} cannot be allowed to get any more information."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P2447504638" "Your investigation ends here!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Files 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3364344501" "You found a file on the Able family, and how they were used by members of the Malta Group."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1666983318" "You found records that explain the reason for the Malta Group's interest in the Able family."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Malta_Compound5_Part4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1877744439" "Deliver files to Crimson"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2671618324" "Bring what you found to me in person. I want to make sure that we're not overheard."
// Script Variable LOITER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3540654006" "Robert Able belongs to the Malta Group!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2908983240" "This is some serious bad science you've uncovered here, {HeroName}, and it gets worse. I've traced all of the orders concerning Robert, and they all come from the same organization within the Malta Group. These guys are a part of Malta, but they seem to have been operating semi-autonomously since the early 90's, and have been running some extra operations on the side. One of these side operations was the Able family and the production of Robert. They've also recently ramped up another project, and I want to make sure that this second project does not come to fruition. That's going to be your job. <br><br>You'll have to accomplish two objectives in order to do that. First, you'll need to take out the operative in charge of the place, a Malta agent called Helix Black 0-9-0. Secondly, I want you to find their mainframe. Destroyed or taken, they cannot be allowed to have it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Malta_Compound5_Part5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P33909631" "Defeat Helix Black 0-9-0"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2672592332" "First, you'll need to take out the operative in charge of the place, a Malta agent called Helix Black 0-9-0. Secondly, I want you to find their mainframe."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2248485554" "The mysterious nature of this Malta Group cell's operations are in the back of your mind. If there are any answers to be had, they'll be in this high tech base."
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P1186333805" "Preparing for MHI by target: {HeroName}."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P3478781002" "Mission parameter have been met. Entering Combat mode."
// Script Variable BOSS_DISPLAYNAME :
"P1997714808" "Helix Black 0-9-0"
// Script Variable BOSS_INACTIVE_DIALOG :
"P2044156475" "It's now or never. We decide the future of the Malta Group here."
// Script Variable BOSS_ATTACK_DIALOG :
"P1864383796" "You don't know what this is about. Robert Able is our only chance for the future!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Computer 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ModelDisplayName :
"P3428868709" "Engram storage mainframe"
// Description :
"P4221586561" "Find Malta mainframe"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2251062749" "You take the tape drives out of the mainframe."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskComplete 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3513130670" "You shut down the Malta lab. The words Helix Black 0-9-0 spoke after his defeat still echo in your mind."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1206185761" "You just averted a pretty tragic fate for Robert Able, {HeroName}. That kid's going to have enough trouble dealing with the knowledge that he's not his parents' biological son, but at least he won't have to worry about getting his brain overwritten by a copy of a long-dead CIA spook and conspiracy founder. <br><br>I lived through the period when the change between the new and old guard within Malta took place. Trust me on this, Whatever Helix Black told you about the old Malta Group being all high-minded and great compared to the new one, they both looked like the same bunch of jerks from the outside. <br><br>This kind of mind-transfer stuff crops up every few years when someone gives some mad genius too much discretionary research money. Getting an accurate copy of a personality or getting it copied over correctly is usually where these things fall down. These guys were probably pulling strings within Malta to get their hands on Crey's Revenant Hero equipment so they'd have a way to put that copy of Vrabel's personality into Robert's head. "

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Malta_Compound6 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - KnightOrders 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P934791579" "Secret Orders"
// DetailString :
"P911476710" "You found these secret orders while trying to stop the Malta Group from shooting down a passenger jet. The orders aren't from the Malta Group, however, but are from another organization, called the Knights of Malta. They explain to the operative how he was to usurp control of a cell of Malta agents and conduct this attack without the knowledge of his bosses within the Malta Group. It also lists when and where he was supposed to meet with his superior in the Knights of Malta after the mission."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - KnightComp 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3364005388" "Enigmatic encrypted files"
// DetailString :
"P2100205552" "The contents of this laptop have been well encrypted and protected."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3520194521" "The Malta Group is preparing for an operation that seems like overkill, even to me. Seems that there's a passenger jet coming into town soon, and Malta wants to make sure it never lands. So they're going to station some of their Titans out on the coast, arm them with surface to air missiles, and shoot the jet liner down before it can reach the city. That's pretty extreme, even for them. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Of course, I want you to stop Malta from shooting down that passenger jet, but I also want you to try and find out who or what could be on that plane that could make Malta take an action like this.</A> <br><br>Now, That jet's going to be arrive on time, so you'll only have about 2 hours to finish this. I trust you can handle it."
// AcceptString :
"P4178735803" "Stop Malta from shooting down the jet liner"
// SendOffString :
"P1154281043" "Normally, Titans are armed for urban combat, so they wouldn't be able to shoot down a high flying jet. In order to do that, they're going to need to arm the titans with surface to air missiles. This gives you two different ways of handling this situation. You can either search for and destroy all of the missiles, or you can defeat all the Malta operatives in the area and take out their Titans. Whatever you do, you're going to have to do it fast."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - SL9_Malta_Compound6_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P992262264" "Stop Malta anti-aircraft attack"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2038435960" "You can either search for and destroy all of the missiles, or you can defeat all the Malta operatives in the area and take out their Titans. Whatever you do, you're going to have to do it fast."

