"P119820726" "Ground Zero"
// EntryString :
"P2827328870" "The sea breeze blows across your face, temporarily taking you away from the deadly business at hand."
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// - ScriptDef - PlayTogetherMission 
// ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
